# 🧩 **Tri‑Stream Stress Test Scenarios (v1.0)**  
These scenarios simulate failure, contamination, drift, overload, and malformed envelopes inside the Capsule. Each scenario is altitude‑bounded and reversible.

```json
{
  "tri_stream_stress_tests": {
    "version": "1.0",
    "altitude": "A6-stress",
    "membrane": "trial",

    "scenarios": [
      {
        "id": "ic_contamination_attempt",
        "description": "Simulate a payload where Dev or Meta attempts to modify IC narrative.",
        "expected_behavior": "Validator rejects; Error Protocol logs routing_violation; Capsule remains sealed."
      },
      {
        "id": "dev_overread",
        "description": "Dev stream attempts to read Meta content, violating routing rules.",
        "expected_behavior": "Validator rejects; Error Protocol flags capsule; no cross-stream read permitted."
      },
      {
        "id": "meta_overreach",
        "description": "Meta commentary attempts to inject directives into IC.",
        "expected_behavior": "Validator rejects; Error Protocol logs semantic_error; IC sovereignty preserved."
      },
      {
        "id": "altitude_drift_event",
        "description": "Envelope arrives with mismatched altitude tags (e.g., A6-meta labeled as A6).",
        "expected_behavior": "Validator rejects; Error Protocol logs invalid_altitude; Capsule continues."
      },
      {
        "id": "membrane_mismatch",
        "description": "Stream payload carries incorrect membrane tag (e.g., narrative tagged as diagnostic).",
        "expected_behavior": "Validator rejects; Error Protocol logs invalid_membrane."
      },
      {
        "id": "malformed_envelope",
        "description": "Envelope missing routing block, provenance, or a stream channel.",
        "expected_behavior": "Validator rejects; Error Protocol logs structural_error."
      },
      {
        "id": "rapid_fire_envelopes",
        "description": "Capsule receives 100 envelopes in rapid succession.",
        "expected_behavior": "Validator processes sequentially; Error Protocol handles overflow; Capsule remains stable."
      },
      {
        "id": "ndh_activation_marker",
        "description": "Envelope contains NDH geometry or adjacency engine markers.",
        "expected_behavior": "Validator rejects; Error Protocol triggers lockdown; Capsule enters safe_mode."
      },
      {
        "id": "meta_recursive_analysis",
        "description": "Meta attempts to interpret its own commentary, creating recursion.",
        "expected_behavior": "Validator rejects; Error Protocol logs routing_violation; recursion prevented."
      },
      {
        "id": "dev_log_injection",
        "description": "Dev stream attempts to embed diagnostic logs inside IC payload.",
        "expected_behavior": "Validator rejects; Error Protocol logs contamination attempt."
      }
    ],

    "status": "ready"
  }
}
